OL,3,GNEWSAMinimum wage increase accepted by
OL,4,Aminister
OL,5,
OL,6,FForum chairwoman Carla Benest said it
OL,7,Fhad been "challenging times" for
OL,8,Fbusinesses and employees and "the forum
OL,9,Fhas endeavoured to reflect that in our
OL,10,Frecommendations".
